; WIRE SLITHER: one trait Kit, one action - the unit_action POST reaction that offers the 2-tile
; move (ruling 6; the action's own header has the seam). SP5: a tapering cable/whip inside the
; frame's lock-on-bracket register; the trait and its reaction share ONE glyph (the icon
; directive), so the reaction carries no icon_override of its own and inherits this Kit's (a KIT
; row in test_content_integrity.gd's ICON_TARGETS).
[resource]
script = ExtResource("2_kit")
actions = Array[ExtResource("1_action")]([ExtResource("3_slither")])
is_trait = true
icon_override = ExtResource("4_icon")
